# Line endings: the repo stores LF; Windows tools (and Python's write_text on Windows) write CRLF. With this file a
# CRLF-only difference is not a change, so `git status` and guncelle.bat only see real edits.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat -text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
